  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C01",
      "text": "天亮前，路边那两辆货车，开进了物流园的B七库位。我租下它，当中转仓。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9e2ada3202269c24fc94976795541e6a518be6a9f634071499e2146943f4fab6",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 219,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C02",
      "text": "清晨五点，粮油批发市场。老李拍着米袋说，新米，一吨四千二。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5349c0c867dd67da6e6ffaecff513aa4976bc85d51caf74b2ca489edcf096fd3",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "start_frame": 222,
      "end_frame": 435,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C03",
      "text": "我抓起一把米，在掌心捻开，闻了闻。这是去年九月的米，仓里返过潮。我只要近三个月的，三千二。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ed9fbf2a2c592ed7f7725460a1203cd05554bb0bcfc6826bf044f09948adba25",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.193563,
      "start_frame": 438,
      "end_frame": 744,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C04",
      "text": "老李愣住，问我，你是同行？我说，做过仓储。三千二，你不亏。他吐出一口烟，成交。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b254df8a3ccf77c0f22370ed6fbd20d1f42372a4029424afd20c8a65a09b00e9",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.380875,
      "start_frame": 747,
      "end_frame": 1029,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "text": "接下来一周，我的小本子，一页页划勾。大米二十吨，面粉十吨，盐、油、罐头、饮用水，柴油和气罐，发电机，种子，羽绒服，还有二十台探照灯。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2f9baaa91ebcb35078056593fa6ae4ff1113222464e6790be8388afc2fcd2c5d",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 16.079844,
      "start_frame": 1032,
      "end_frame": 1515,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C06",
      "text": "老李问，买探照灯干什么。我说，防小偷。其实我本子上写着，怕光，怕火，耳朵灵。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f3607fa4b5abf92bba833de5a1472823d5a5a1aa332a5e72780af4c970619710",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "start_frame": 1518,
      "end_frame": 1812,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C07",
      "text": "货车到了，我蹲在车上，教工人交错码垛，垫板，放脱氧剂。码得好，十年不坏。工人说，陈老板，你比我们老板还专业。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "abf3d44a0aa9959026e9fd05e0ce6d542fe82d75cfed145a21815c73bba0325b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 12.968375,
      "start_frame": 1815,
      "end_frame": 2205,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C08",
      "text": "燃料我全放在物流园，一滴都没往小区运。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1f3358191e73864606f364be39359e24a5dfdb6514265089731a548bd9c7d3a2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "start_frame": 2208,
      "end_frame": 2334,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C09",
      "text": "可王大富，已经把我的聊天记录截了图，发进业主群。本栋有人精神异常，大量囤积危险品。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5c0507ff6639c3850beb28b60218e767d225d7ae1e583c2444f3122455d7b888",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "start_frame": 2337,
      "end_frame": 2604,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C10",
      "text": "群里一片哈哈哈。楼下的孩子追着我喊，末日叔叔。我提着一袋面粉，目不斜视。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2be9808542e331a7130669eaaf521092cc7403498dc9303ec710a25b7aeb1a8a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "start_frame": 2607,
      "end_frame": 2841,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C11",
      "text": "我在群里回了一个字，嗯。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "afd919b4cfb3bff4528624334cd2a3f41f4366847456b899f10adea2acfa81fa",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 2.890906,
      "start_frame": 2844,
      "end_frame": 2931,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C12",
      "text": "单元门上，物业新贴了通知，禁止堆放易燃物。我看了一眼，转身去了物流园。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e6acbee8279f51be9d68500918244243117d4ffc986682ad81a858cdeb1d5a0e",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "start_frame": 2934,
      "end_frame": 3153,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "text": "那晚，园区经理来电，说有批货的报备资料不全，今晚必须补。我带着合同赶到B七库，库门刚拉开，一道手电光，直直照在我脸上。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP004/audio/EP004-C13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ce325fba5a9794cf5df08093d7fe685838e660c729e0922fc036e79c941b1481",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 13.4,
      "start_frame": 3156,
      "end_frame": 3558,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    }
  ],
